# PSN NPSSO Token for PlayStation Network trophy access
# To get your token:
# 1. Log in to https://ca.account.sony.com/api/v1/ssocookie in your browser
# 2. Copy the npsso token value from the response
# 3. Paste it below (replace YOUR_NPSSO_TOKEN_HERE)

https://ca.account.sony.com/api/v1/ssocookie

YOUR_NPSSO_TOKEN_HERE
